 Stephanie S. Dawes, Laboratory of Structural Biology, School of Biological Sciences and Maurice Wilkins Centre for Molecular Biodiscovery, University of Auckland, Auckland, New Zealand.”\nL95: \nL96: Page 14, Acknowledgments, line 3: “and Stephanie Dawes for providing the ΔmetE cobK::hyg mutant” was deleted.\nL97: \nL98: Page 14, Acknowledgments, lines 1 and 2 from bottom: “(to V.M. and D.F.W.)” was changed to “(to S.S.D., V.M., and D.F.W.).”\nL99: ## Information & Contributors\nL100: \nL101: ### Information\nL102: \nL103: #### Published In\nL104: \nL105: 【67†Image: cover image Journal of Bacteriology】\nL106: \nL107: Journal of Bacteriology\nL108: \nL109: Volume 204 • Number 3 • 15 March 2022\nL110: \nL111: eLocator: e00004-22\nL112: \nL113: PubMed: 【68†35289639†pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL114: \nL115: #### Copyright\nL116: \nL117: © 2022 American Society for Microbiology. 【69†All Rights Reserved†doi.org】.\nL118: \nL119: #### History\nL120: \nL121: Published online: 15 March 2022\nL122: \nL123: #### Permissions\nL124: \nL125: Request permissions for this article.\nL126: \nL127: 【70†Request Permissions†marketplace.copyright.com】\nL128: #### Topics\nL129: \nL130:   1. 【71†Bacteriology】\nL131:   2. 【72†Cobalamin (Vitamin B12) Metabolism】\nL132:   3. 【73†Coenzyme B12 Biosynthesis】\nL133:   4. 【74†Cofactor Metabolism】\nL134:   5. 【75†Metabolism】\nL135:   6. 【76†Microbial Physiology and Genetics】\nL136:   7. 【77†Vitamin B12 Metabolism】\nL137:   8. 【78†Vitamin Biosynthesis】\nL138: \nL139: 【79†Download PDF】\nL140: \nL141: ### Contributors\nL142: #### Authors\nL143: \nL144: Terry Kipkorir\nL145: \nL146: SAMRC/NHLS/UCT Molecular Mycobacteriology Research Unit, Department of Pathology and Institute of Infectious Disease and Molecular Medicine, Faculty of Health Sciences, DSI/NRF Centre of Excellence for Biomedical TB Research, University of Cape Town, Cape Town, South Africa\nL147: \nL148: 【80†View all articles by Terry Kipkorir】\nL149: \nL150: Gabriel T. Mashabela\nL151: SAMR